---
title: Environment Lifecycle
---
flowchart TD
    subgraph "Developer Environment (per feature branch)"
        PUSH[Feature branch created<br/>from work item]
        BUILD_F[build.yml<br/>Compile + Package]
        PROV_F[provision-environment.yml<br/>New-AdminPowerAppEnvironment]
        WAIT_F[Wait 4 hours<br/>Environment stabilization<br/>Agentless server delay]
        GOV_F[Match governance config<br/>Managed Environment alignment]
        COPY_F[post-provision-copy.yml<br/>Copy DB from known good source]
        SANDBOX_F[("Dev Environment Ready<br/>~5-6 hours total")]
        DEV_WORK[Developer works<br/>against real data]
        DEV_TEST[Developer tests<br/>against real data]
    end

    subgraph "PR Test Environment (automatic, per PR)"
        PR[Create PR to main]
        PROV_PR[Provision test env<br/>pr-NUMBER]
        COPY_PR[Copy DB from<br/>known good source]
        DEPLOY_PR[Deploy package<br/>+ DB Sync]
        TEST_PR[OData smoke tests<br/>+ other tests]
        TEAR_PR[Teardown PR env<br/>Always runs]
        RESULT{Confirms code can<br/>merge, deploy,<br/>and DB sync}
    end

    subgraph "Cleanup (automated)"
        ACCEPT[PR accepted<br/>merged to main]
        CLEANUP[cleanup-environments.yml<br/>Daily scheduled<br/>Deletes orphaned envs]
        DELETE_PR[Delete PR test env<br/>Teardown job - always runs]
    end

    PUSH --> BUILD_F
    PUSH --> PROV_F
    PROV_F --> WAIT_F
    WAIT_F --> GOV_F
    GOV_F --> COPY_F
    COPY_F --> SANDBOX_F
    SANDBOX_F --> DEV_WORK
    DEV_WORK --> DEV_TEST
    DEV_TEST --> PR

    PR --> PROV_PR
    PROV_PR --> WAIT_PR[Wait 3 hours<br/>Agentless delay]
    WAIT_PR --> COPY_PR
    COPY_PR --> DEPLOY_PR
    DEPLOY_PR --> TEST_PR
    TEST_PR --> RESULT
    RESULT -->|pass| TEAR_PR
    RESULT -->|fail| TEAR_PR

    RESULT -->|pass| ACCEPT
    ACCEPT --> CLEANUP
    ACCEPT --> DELETE_PR

    style SANDBOX_F fill:#e8f5e9,stroke:#4caf50,stroke-width:2px
    style PROV_F fill:#f3e5f5,stroke:#9c27b0
